Error [jet.UsePrivateModuleItem]: `helper` is private in module `dep`
  --> main.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     dep.[helper]
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `priv module` is usable only by its enclosing module, and a `priv(package) module` only by its own package
 Fix: Use what `dep` makes public, or import `helper` from inside its package
